	Bit 0	= Code 47 - Not used
	Bit 1	= Code 46 - No ref pulses
	Bit 2	= Code 45 - Oxygen sensor rich
	Bit 3	= Code 44 - Oxygen sensor lean
	Bit 4 = Code 43 - Knock sensor failure
	Bit 5 = Code 42 - Bypass circuit Open or shorted
	Bit 6 = Code 41 - EST circuit open or shorted
	Bit 7 = Code 39 - Not used

